span on only for a 4400x1080 screen

The spantest build turned span mode (and the home-screen bottom) on for
every container. The build-type defaults SPAN_DEFAULT / SPAN_BOTTOM_DEFAULT
now apply only when the container's screen size is 4400x1080, the Thor span
canvas (1240 home screen + 1920 top panel + 1240 unused). Any other size
gets the stock fallbacks ("false" / ""), so it runs exactly like stock
single-screen. An explicit spanDisplay / spanBottom container extra still
wins, so the rooted span build behaves as before. Builds with
SPAN_DEFAULT=false (stock, debug, span) are unchanged.


---

